'''Capy''' (カルピンチョ, ''Karupincho'', '''Carpincho''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in [[Legend Stages]], [[The Aku Realms]] and the [[Zombie Outbreaks]] of [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. She was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]].

