==Trivia==
*She is based on the [[wikipedia:Capybara|capybara]], the world's largest extant species of rodent.
**Her Japanese name, Carpincho, is the Spanish word for capybara.
*Her red fur, attack animation and tendency to kill units in a single hit may be referencing the [[wikia:earthbound:Ultimate Chimera|Ultimate Chimera]] from the game ''[[wikipedia:Mother 3|Mother 3]]''.
*Her love of hot springs mentioned in her Japanese description would eventually be her downfall, leading to her melting on a tour of the [[wikipedia:Hells of Beppu|Hells of Beppu]] and becoming [[Zapy]]. Coincidentally, she also appears in [[Boiling Spring]] which would reference hot springs.

